      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the spawned child process\u0027s environment** immediately before the process starts. \n\nSpecifically, the page says that a local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it only into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process \u2014 it is never held in or written into the Hub\u0027s own process environment. The same scoping model applies to the Query agent process as well: both receive the credential injected into their own environment at spawn time, never inherited from the Hub\u0027s process environment.",
